"""Original calm, economical fictional fan viewpoints, without personal claims."""
DISCUSSIONS = {
'order66_loss': ('The scene stops to register what was lost. That silence gives the audience room to understand the damage.', 'The silence lets the loss sink in.'),
'presence': ('Vader wastes very little movement. The stillness makes every person around him look less certain.', 'Vader barely moves. Everyone else gets nervous.'),
'redemption': ('The decisive move is Vader refusing the Emperor. The ending turns on a choice, not a better weapon.', 'Vader finally refuses the Emperor. That choice ends it.'),
'loyalty': ('Chewie stays useful under pressure without demanding the center of the scene. That is an underrated kind of loyalty.', 'Chewie helps when things get rough. No big speech needed.'),
'wisdom': ('Yoda asks Luke to reconsider his assumptions before trying harder. Effort aimed at the wrong problem stays wasted effort.', 'Yoda makes Luke rethink the problem first.'),
'music': ('The Imperial March gives a scene direction before a word is spoken. Remove it and the same entrance lands differently.', 'Take away the March. The entrance feels different.'),
'duel_pacing': ('A duel needs readable decisions between the strikes. Constant movement would hide the moment a fighter changes tactics.', 'The pauses show when a fighter changes plans.'),
'leia_leadership': ('Leia gives clear instructions while others are still absorbing the danger. Clarity becomes a practical advantage.', 'Leia gives clear orders while others panic.'),
'r2_solutions': ('R2 keeps turning small access problems into opportunities. The escape plan depends on those unglamorous details.', 'R2 fixes the small things the escape needs.'),
'opening_scale': ('The opening pursuit makes the smaller ship look trapped before the fighting begins. The frame does the explaining.', 'The opening chase already makes the rebels look trapped.'),
'lightsaber_colour': ('The blade colors separate the fighters even in a dark frame. That makes a fast exchange easier to read.', 'The bright blade colors help you follow the fight.'),
'cloud_city_reveal': ('Luke receives the truth with no safe place to process it. The location makes the revelation more punishing.', 'Luke gets the truth with nowhere safe to think.'),
'breathing_sound': ('The regular breathing cuts through a quiet scene with precision. Vader can establish a threat before the camera finds him.', 'You hear the breathing before you see the danger.'),
'suit_life_support': ('The suit is both protection and a dependency. That tension makes its imposing appearance more than decoration.', 'The suit protects Vader. He also depends on it.'),
'anakin_hero_past': ('The earlier hero gives Vader a meaningful contrast. Without that history, the fall would carry less weight.', 'Knowing Anakin was a hero makes the fall heavier.'),
'padme_fear': ('Anakin mistakes fear for a reliable guide. The choices made to prevent loss become part of the disaster.', 'Anakin follows his fear. It helps cause the loss.'),
'vader_pilot': ('Vader closes the distance himself in the trench battle. The pursuit feels sharper when the commander also takes the controls.', 'Vader takes the controls. The chase gets more dangerous.'),
'tie_silhouette': ('Vader\'s fighter is identifiable at a glance. A clear outline can do more than an extra line of explanation.', 'You can spot Vader\'s fighter by its outline.'),
'luke_farm_beginning': ('Luke\'s ordinary chores give the later adventure a useful baseline. The distance traveled becomes easier to feel.', 'The farm chores make Luke\'s later journey feel huge.'),
'dagobah_failures': ('Luke\'s failures expose impatience rather than a simple lack of strength. Training becomes a problem of judgment.', 'Luke needs better judgment, not just more power.'),
'yoda_teaching_centuries': ('Eight centuries of teaching puts a single impatient student in perspective. Yoda\'s measured pace has a reason.', 'Yoda taught for 800 years. Luke is one rushed student.'),
'yoda_species_mystery': ('The unknown species leaves the focus on Yoda\'s conduct. A complete explanation would not improve every part of the character.', 'Yoda does not need every mystery explained.'),
'leia_adoption': ('Bail\'s role is built through raising Leia, not a dramatic bloodline reveal. Family includes the steady work.', 'Bail raised Leia. The steady care counts.'),
'skywalker_twins': ('The twins share an origin but reach the conflict by different routes. Their choices keep them distinct.', 'Luke and Leia share roots. Their paths are different.'),
'han_yavin_return': ('Han returning at Yavin turns a stated priority into a tested one. The timing makes his decision count.', 'Han comes back when it matters. That proves the choice.'),
'han_hoth_rescue': ('Han goes out into the cold because leaving Luke there is unacceptable. The risk gives friendship a concrete measure.', 'Han risks the cold to find Luke. That is friendship.'),
'falcon_hyperdrive': ('An unreliable hyperdrive prevents escape from becoming a simple button press. The mechanical problem keeps changing the plan.', 'The broken hyperdrive keeps ruining the easy escape.'),
'falcon_modifications': ('The Falcon\'s worn exterior conceals useful changes. A vehicle\'s condition is not the same as its capability.', 'The Falcon looks worn. It still has useful upgrades.'),
'deathstar_weakness': ('A narrow weakness matters only if someone can reach it. The attack still demands timing, skill and an opening.', 'The weak spot exists. Reaching it is still hard.'),
'deathstar_secrecy': ('The stolen plans change what the rebels can attempt. Useful information creates an option that force alone did not.', 'The plans give the rebels a chance they lacked.'),
'r2_bravery': ('R2 repeatedly enters dangerous situations to keep the mission moving. Courage can be practical and almost wordless.', 'R2 keeps going into danger to help.'),
'r2_generations': ('R2 links different periods through continued service. The familiar droid quietly carries history across the films.', 'R2 connects different generations of the story.'),
'threepio_builder': ('Anakin building Threepio gives an ordinary machine an unexpected history. The later encounters carry that extra connection.', 'Threepio has an unexpected link back to Anakin.'),
'threepio_translation': ('Threepio\'s language skills solve problems that a weapon cannot. Communication is part of the equipment a team needs.', 'Threepio can solve a problem by understanding the words.'),
'walker_transport': ('An AT-AT delivers troops as well as intimidation. Its role in the attack explains the scale of the machine.', 'The giant walker carries troops into the attack.'),
'walker_intimidation': ('The walkers advance slowly enough to feel inevitable. Speed is not the only way a machine can create pressure.', 'Those slow walkers feel hard to stop.'),
}
